msgstr "Unfortunately, you cannot accept this invitation at the moment. This may be because the invitation has expired, or because the output cannot be edited any more."

msgid "You, %(name)s, have been invited to be a speaker for the session “%(talk)s”. Do you accept the invitation?"
msgstr "You, %(name)s, have been invited to be an author for the session “%(talk)s”. Do you accept the invitation?"

msgid "You do not need an account to view the event, or submit feedback, or receive schedule updates. You’ll only need an account if you participate in the event as speaker or as an organiser."
msgstr "You do not need an account to view the review round, or submit feedback, or receive schedule updates. You’ll only need an account if you participate in the review round as author or as an organiser."

